From: YanIanZ <iwayanbagusaryadarma@student.telkomuniversity.ac.id>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] SourbyCraft provision packet plugins before the plugin scan

Enter the existing verified plugin provisioning from the active SourbyClip
server path, before PluginInitializerManager scans the selected plugin folder.
This covers ViaVersion/ViaBackwards and the independent ProtocolLib pin.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/Main.java b/net/minecraft/server/Main.java
index 6ea93cb722fd5dc30cae844a536b39dfdb9a2fdc..a98584329387836a5fddcfdd6331892b7f278d34 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/Main.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/Main.java
@@ -123,6 +123,9 @@ public class Main {
                 JvmProfiler.INSTANCE.start(Environment.SERVER);
             }
 
+            // SourbyCraft: Clip has loaded the server; provision before Paper scans plugins.
+            dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.bootstrap.PluginProvisioner.provisionJars(
+                ((java.io.File) options.valueOf("plugins")).toPath());
             io.papermc.paper.plugin.PluginInitializerManager.load(options); // Paper
             Bootstrap.bootStrap();
             Bootstrap.validate();
